Patch Instructions for Integrating SD Card Initialization

1. Add the include at the top of main.c:

#include "sdcard_init.h"

2. Add the following code at the end of the main() function, just before any 
   main loop or the return statement:

    /* Initialize SD card in a delayed manner to avoid BLE disruption */
    printk("Scheduling delayed SD card initialization\n");
    sdcard_init_async();

3. If any existing SD card initialization code exists in main.c, remove it or 
   comment it out, as the new system will handle this safely.

4. Build with:
   ./build.sh

5. Flash with:
   west flash